  "note": "Saudi Arabia surfaces the widest window in the family, register through clock, because a government works contract here carries the advance payment guarantee, the retention and the interim payment certificate in one arc and none of them is optional. The Engineer certifies, the authority pays against the certificate, and the invoice is the last document rather than the first.",
